File Index

/package.json
Purpose: @shatteredarchive/psd-viewer-client manifest — Vite + React 19, plugin-react-swc; dev/build/preview scripts.

/vite.config.ts
Purpose: Vite config — port 62080, alias @ → src, and the /api + /health proxy to psd-viewer-server (localhost:62000).

/index.html
Purpose: SPA shell mounting src/main.tsx into #root.

/tsconfig.json
Purpose: Bundler-resolution DOM+JSX build config extending the repo base.

/README.md
Purpose: What the client is, its decode-server relationship, and how to run it.

/src/main.tsx
Purpose: React entry — mounts <App/> under StrictMode, imports index.css.

/src/App.tsx
Purpose: The entire UI — preset chips + path input, fetches /api/psd/png once per open, shows the PNG blob via an object URL, and the Save-as-PNG download; manages loading/error state and revokes stale object URLs.

/src/index.css
Purpose: Dark-theme styling — controls panel, preset chips, checkerboard image backdrop, meta row + save button.
